# Stand-ins the B2 asset build may contain (4.15 item 7).
#
# A stub is any stand-in for data of the original (a marker, a flat-colour texture, a default
# material, a skipped clip). The pipeline has no path that makes one, so this list is empty and
# `civ5-assets verify` fails on any stub event (stubs-b2.json in the output directory) that is not
# listed here. For AC-R3.1 this file never has a line about a unit.
#
# One entry per line:   id | reason | owner | YYYY-MM-DD
